        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00285:alt:fig-00002-alt",
          "text": "The reaction of ethyl acetoacetate with 3-buten-2-one with sodium ethoxide in ethanol, then hydronium ion, forms a conjugate addition product with an extended carbon chain."
        },
        "src": "../../media/OChem_23_10_002.jpg",
        "mimeType": "image/jpeg"
