        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00285:alt:fig-00003-alt",
          "text": "An arrow-pushing mechanism of the Michael reaction of ethyl-3-oxobutanoate involving three steps. These are proton abstraction, formation of an enolate, and product formation."
        },
        "src": "../../media/OChem_23_10_003.jpg",
        "mimeType": "image/jpeg"
      }
