                "align": "left"
              },
              "alt": {
                "segmentId": "m00285:alt:OChem_23_10_004g_jpg-alt",
                "text": "The structure of beta-diketone, a Michael donor. Carbonyl with substituent R is bonded to C H 2, which is bonded to another carbonyl with substituent R prime.",
                "mediaId": null,
                "src": "../../media/OChem_23_10_004g.jpg"
              }
            },
            {
              "segmentId": "m00285:entry:auto-17",
              "attributes": {
                "valign": "top",
                "align": "left"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            {
              "segmentId": null,
              "attributes": {
                "valign": "top",
                "align": "left"
              },
              "alt": {
                "segmentId": "m00285:alt:OChem_23_10_004b_jpg-alt",
                "text": "The structure of but-3-en-2-one (Michael acceptor) shows a four-carbon chain with a carbonyl at the second carbon. A double bond connects the third and fourth carbon.",
                "mediaId": null,
                "src": "../../media/OChem_23_10_004b.jpg"
              }
            },
            {
              "segmentId": "m00285:entry:auto-19",
              "attributes": {
                "valign": "top",
                "align": "left"
              }
            },
            {
              "segmentId": null,
              "attributes": {
                "valign": "top",
                "align": "left"
              },
              "alt": {
                "segmentId": "m00285:alt:OChem_23_10_004h_jpg-alt",
                "text": "The beta-keto ester has a C H 2 group between two carbonyls. An ethoxy group is attached to one terminal carbonyl, and an R group is on the other terminus.",
                "mediaId": null,
                "src": "../../media/OChem_23_10_004h.jpg"
              }
            },
            {
              "segmentId": "m00285:entry:auto-21",
              "attributes": {
                "valign": "top",
                "align": "left"
              }
            }
