              },
              "alt": {
                "segmentId": "m00285:alt:OChem_23_10_004j_jpg-alt",
                "text": "The structure of beta-keto nitrile, Michael donor. R is bonded to the carbonyl group which is further bonded to methylene. Methylene is bonded with a cyanide group.",
                "mediaId": null,
                "src": "../../media/OChem_23_10_004j.jpg"
              }
            },
            {
              "segmentId": "m00285:entry:auto-29",
