              },
              "alt": {
                "segmentId": "m00285:alt:OChem_23_10_004k_jpg-alt",
                "text": "The structure of a nitro compound, Michael-donor. R group is single-bonded to methylene which is further linked to the nitro group.",
                "mediaId": null,
                "src": "../../media/OChem_23_10_004k.jpg"
              }
            },
